    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esita yalanga emuruchi naHamani khwisabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga yakhataru Esita yeefwala tsingubo tsieshiruchi, nasinjila mulwanyi Iwomukari Iweinzu yomuruchi, ahahengana neinzu yomuruchi; naye omuruchi yali niyeekhaale khushifumbi shioburuchi, munzu yoburuchi, ahahengana nobwinjililo bweinzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa omuruchi yalola Esita omukhaye nasinjiile mulwanyi yamukoosia obukoosia; omuruchi nanyiilila Esita indabushi yeitsahaabu eya yali ninayo mumukhono. Kho Esita nasita ahambi, natiilakhwo hashikong'o shieindabushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi namureeba mbu Omukhaye Esita, eshia wenya nishiina? Eshia osaba nishi? Olaheebwa, kata khunusu yoburuchi bwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita nakalusia mbu Omuruchi naba nachama, omuruchi nende Hamani beetse leero khwisabo elia emukholeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi naboola mbu Yanguyilisie Hamani, khukhole aka Esita yeenya. Kho omuruchi naHamani nibatsia khwisabo elia Esita yali nakasiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa bali nibanyweetsanga idivai, omuruchi yamureeba Esita mbu Lisaayolio lili lirie? Olaheebwa. Eshia osaba nishiina? Shilakholwa, kata okhuula khunusu yoburuchi bwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Esita nakalusia ari Lisaayo lianje, elia esaba, ndielino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu nimba ningoosibwa imbeli womuruchi, khandi omuruchi naba nachama okhuhaana elia esaayile, nokhukhola elia emusabile, omuruchi naHamani beetse khwisabo elia nembakholele, mana mukamba ndalakhola aka omuruchi aboolile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omusaala kwakasibwa okhwelesibwakhwo Moridekai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Hamani yarula inyanga eyo niyeekhoya, natsatsahaale mumwoyo; habula olwa Hamani yalola Moridekai nali muluyia Iwewomuruchi, shinga olwa arasinjila kata okhutechela imbeliwe ta, yatiililwa Moridekai oburima muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa Hamani yeesimilisia, natsia ingo; narumana okhulanga abeetsabe nende Zereshi omukhasiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani nabatoonyela akoluyali Iwobuyindabwe, nobunji bwabaanabe, namakhuwa kosi aka omuruchi yali namwemeeshekhwo, khandi shinga olwa yali namuchinguulile okhuyomba abakhulundu nabasumba bomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Hamani nasunga mbu Toto, kata Esita omukhaye womuruchi shiyamoka omundu yesi okhwinjila halala nomuruchi mwisabo elia yali nakasiye ta, habula isie sienyene; ne mukamba khandi yananjile halala nomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa kano kosi shikangasila ta, nishilolanga Moridekai omuYahudi niyeekhaale muluyia Iwewomuruchi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Zereshi omukhasiwe, nende abeetsabe bosi, nibamuboolela mbu Laka bakhole omusaala kwoburambi bwamakhono amakhumi karaano, mana nibushia mukamba osunjile omuruchi mbu Moridekai yeelesibwekhwo; nawe mana notsie notsatsahaale, niwinjila halala nomuruchi khwisabo. Likhuwa elo nilumuchamisia Hamani; nalaka mbu omusaala tsana kukholwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
